	(descr "JST PA series connector, B05B-PASK-1, 5-pin 2.00 mm pitch vertical (top entry) through-hole header WITH locating boss. Drawn from the JST PA family drawing (ePA-F.pdf): pin span A = 8.00 mm, housing B = 12.00 mm, housing depth 5.30 mm (2.20 mm behind / 3.10 mm in front of the pin row), housing height 7.7 mm, pin hole 0.7 +0.1/-0 mm, boss hole 1.1 +0.1/-0 mm located 1.50 mm beyond pin 1 along the pin axis and 1.70 mm off the pin-row centreline. Rated 3 A / 250 V AC-DC, AWG 28-22. Mates PAP-05V-S housing + SPH-002T-P0.5 contacts. NOT intermateable with JST PH.")
